// The owner's exact reducer (2026-08-19): madc::value is an INHERENT
// madc-mode type — streaming one to cout requires NO includes. Bare
// `cout` arrives via the auto-include prelude; the value inserter
// declaration arrives via the lexer's bits/value_stream injection at
// that include's completion (keyed on the ostream guard macro).
var test = "hello";
cout << test << endl;
